<title>USA: Rite Aid stake held by FMR group.</title>
<headline>Rite Aid stake held by FMR group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by FMR Corp said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Monday it holds a 10.29 percent stake in Rite Aid Corp, or 12,619,500 common shares.</p>
<p>The group disclosed its latest position on Rite Aid in a 13G filing. FMR Corp is the parent to Fidelity Management &amp; Research Co, the investment adviser to Fidelity Funds.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
